<title>POLAND: MOSTOSTAL KRAKOW TRADES ON KERB AT PLN 21.</title>
<headline>MOSTOSTAL KRAKOW TRADES ON KERB AT PLN 21.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>A kerb transaction in 102,000 shares in Mostostal Krakow at 21 zlotys was struck on the Warsaw bourse on Tuesday, the bourse said in a statement.</p>
<p>At the regular session, Mostostal Krakow was trading at 20.8 zlotys in a 37,128-share volume.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
